      "side": 1,
      "message": "NB: Dumping the soongMetricsFile here will include the creation/completion timestamp from *this* invocation of soong_ui. We need to consider how we\u0027re going to amend the creation/completion timestamp of soong_metrics for the upload invocation. If we want the upload-only invocation to read soong_metrics into memory and rewrite it with updated timestamps, we won\u0027t need a flag --creation-time, as we originally discussed.",
