      "writtenOn": "2022-12-07T18:15:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To amend my statement slightly, there are (at least) two creation timestamps to consider:\n\n1. The one present in soong_metrics. See https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/metrics/metrics_proto/metrics.proto;l\u003d22;drc\u003df2a80c6396524e9c554298feca98f0cc5416b8b2\n2. The one used in the uploader params (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/build/upload.go;l\u003d116;drc\u003da055bbd25add3d35583fd3d1a623a68533f6766d)\n\nWe need to make sure these are sourced from the same location. They could both be derived from the soong_metrics output in the first invocation (which is read by the --upload-only run)",
